## GTM Overview

### Strategy Summary

MedSync's GTM strategy focuses on enterprise-led growth, product-led expansion, and ecosystem partnerships. Key shifts for 2025 include AI-driven differentiation, account-based marketing at scale, and channel acceleration.

### GTM Pillars

| Pillar | FY 2024 | FY 2025 |
|--------|---------|---------|
| Enterprise Direct | 45% of new ARR | 50% of new ARR |
| Mid-Market Direct | 40% of new ARR | 35% of new ARR |
| SMB/Self-Service | 10% of new ARR | 10% of new ARR |
| Channel/Partners | 5% of new ARR | 5% of new ARR |

